{
    "id":  453,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "Recessed LED 2W 4W 6W FREYA White 3CCT | Bridgelux COB 130Lm/W | UGR11 40°",
    "reference":  "92208-PACK120",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eFREYA Circular LED Downlight\u003c/strong\u003e delivers maximum versatility with a \u003cb\u003e2W - 4W - 6W power selector\u003c/b\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e3CCT technology\u003c/strong\u003e, allowing you to choose the ideal color temperature for any space. Its \u003cstrong\u003e130Lm/W Bridgelux COB chip\u003c/strong\u003e ensures high efficiency, while the \u003cstrong\u003e40° beam angle\u003c/strong\u003e provides precise and focused lighting. With \u003cstrong\u003eUGR\u0026lt;11\u003c/strong\u003e, it eliminates glare for visual comfort. Its design allows for \u003cstrong\u003equick and easy installation\u003c/strong\u003e, making it perfect for both professional and residential projects.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eDownlight LED 2W - 4W - 6W FREYA 3CCT | White | Bridgelux COB 130Lm/W | 24° | UGR11\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eFREYA Circular LED Downlight\u003c/strong\u003e is a professional lighting solution designed to provide versatility, efficiency, and visual comfort in all types of projects. Thanks to its \u003cb\u003eintegrated power selector (2W - 4W - 6W)\u003c/b\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e3CCT technology\u003c/strong\u003e, it allows easy selection of the most suitable light intensity and color temperature for any space, adapting to both residential and commercial environments.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt features a \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-performance Bridgelux COB chip (130Lm/W)\u003c/strong\u003e, ensuring powerful and uniform lighting with reduced energy consumption. Its \u003cstrong\u003e40° beam angle\u003c/strong\u003e is designed to deliver more focused light, perfect for highlighting specific areas, creating cozy atmospheres, or showcasing products in display windows and exhibition areas.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe optical design of the FREYA ensures superior comfort thanks to its \u003cstrong\u003eUGR\u0026lt;11\u003c/strong\u003e, which significantly reduces glare and protects visual health in spaces where lighting remains on for extended periods, such as offices, hotels, restaurants, or homes.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn addition to its excellent lighting performance, this downlight has been designed for \u003cstrong\u003eeasy and safe installation\u003c/strong\u003e, optimizing installers’ time. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e✅ \u003cstrong\u003eRecommended applications:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKitchens\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBathrooms\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHallways\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHotels\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLiving rooms\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eShops\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA typographical error has been detected on the driver. The label shows 5W-8W-12W, but the actual operating values are 2W-4W-6W. We apologize for any inconvenience and kindly ask you to take the correct power ratings into account during installation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIn FactorLED we ensure that our products have a QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for the DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gtx-trans\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gtx-trans-icon\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
